            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.60

- Switching between Briefing, Map and Weather in the main window is smoother. Briefing and Weather stay loaded, so switching between them no longer rebuilds the page.
- The map shows a brief loading indicator while it opens, so the Briefing / Map / Weather switch slides without stuttering.
- The Refresh button now stays in the toolbar on Weather too, and refreshes whichever section is showing.
- The window title reads "Weather" on the Weather page.
]]></description>
